he likes of Mason Greenwood , Vedat Muriqi , and N'Golo Kante . Despite the heavy pressure and the introduction of Nelson Semedo and Kerem Akturkoglu to spark the attack, the Genclerbirligi backline stood firm. They weathered the storm until the final whistle at 90+6', securing a famous victory against one of the giants of Turkish football."
