essure. In the dying embers of the match, the intensity boiled over, resulting in a series of disciplinary actions. Nelson Semedo was booked in the 86th minute, followed by a rapid succession of yellow cards in injury time for Mason Greenwood , Fred , and Matteo Guendouzi . These interruptions disrupted the flow of the final attacks, and after five minutes of added time, the referee brought an end to a hard-fought contest that showcased the defensive resilience of both European contenders."
